# Process 4, the body of draw.Views.

{3. Index the declarations}
> design, code
[4.1. Link each version of each diagram
 so dfd draws references, items and terms as links
 (draw.link)]
> linked design, footnotes
[4.2. Diff the linked versions
 so dfd can draw each change
 (draw.diff)]
> linked design, patches, footnotes
[4.3. Run dfd for each view
 (draw.render)]
> views
{5. Read the notes}

# type: design = *design.Design
# type: code = *code.Index
# type: linked design = draw.linked
# type: footnotes = map[string]string
# type: patches = map[string]string
# type: views = []draw.View
